# The repository-wide `*.log` rule keeps multi-MB runtime logs (llama-server,
# driver) under SPEECHRL_DATA_DIR out of Git. The two `*.log` files here are not
# runtime logs: they are the stdout transcripts of this offline derivation --
# including both frozen-scorer reconciliations -- i.e. the evidence this archive
# exists to preserve. Re-include them here only.
!*.log
